    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s the thing... i don’t think \"grounding\" even works anymore. it feels like i'm just trying to tie a knot in smoke. nothing feels heavy or solid. even when i try to touch things, it’s like there’s this layer of static between me and the world. it's like i've already faded out, and the physical stuff is just a leftover projection. i feel more like a piece of code than a person.",
